(# Hospital Management System \(HMS\)) Tj
T* (## Technical Specification and Tech Stack) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Document date: February 17, 2026) Tj
T* (Scope baseline: repository state in `c:\\xampp\\htdocs\\Hospital_Management_System`) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 1. System Overview) Tj
T* (HMS is a role-based, multi-module web application for hospital operations. It supports Admin, ) Tj
T* (Doctor, Nurse, Nurse Aid, Reception, Pharmacy \(including Senior Pharmacist\), and IT Support ) Tj
T* (workflows.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Primary design goals:) Tj
T* (- Centralized patient flow from registration to consultation and pharmacy.) Tj
T* (- Role-based access control and protected API endpoints.) Tj
T* (- Near real-time dashboard refresh across roles.) Tj
T* (- Operational observability through health checks and audit logs.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 2. Architecture) Tj
T* (HMS follows a modular monolith + realtime sidecar pattern:) Tj
T* (- Frontend: static HTML pages per role with vanilla JavaScript.) Tj
T* (- Backend API: PHP entry router \(`backend/index.php`\) dispatching to route modules.) Tj
T* (- Database: MySQL \(`hospital_db`\) with core schema + runtime ensure/migration helpers.) Tj
T* (- Realtime service: Node.js WebSocket server \(`realtime/server.js`\) with HTTP emit bridge.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Data flow:) Tj
T* (1. Browser calls REST-like endpoints on `backend/index.php/<module>/<action>`.) Tj
T* (2. Backend authenticates JWT and enforces roles.) Tj
T* (3. Backend reads/writes MySQL and logs audit events.) Tj
T* (4. Backend emits realtime events to Node sidecar \(`/emit`\).) Tj
T* (5. Connected dashboards refresh data through WebSocket + periodic auto-refresh.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 3. Technology Stack) Tj
T* (### 3.1 Backend) Tj
T* (- Language: PHP \(XAMPP environment\).) Tj
T* (- Dependency manager: Composer.) Tj
T* (- Auth library: `firebase/php-jwt` ^7.0.) Tj
T* (- API style: module/action routes through a single front controller.) Tj
T* (- Realtime integration: HTTP POST to sidecar \(`backend/utils/Realtime.php`\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 3.2 Frontend) Tj
T* (- HTML5 + CSS3 + Vanilla JavaScript.) Tj
T* (- CSS/JS framework: Bootstrap 5.3.3.) Tj
T* (- Icons: Bootstrap Icons 1.11.x.) Tj
T* (- Charts: Chart.js 4.4.1 in analytics-heavy dashboards.) Tj
T* (- Session storage: `localStorage` for JWT and user payload.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 3.3 Realtime Service) Tj
T* (- Runtime: Node.js 18+ \(project requirement\).) Tj
T* (- Library: `ws` ^8.17.0.) Tj
T* (- Ports: default HTTP + WebSocket on 8090.) Tj
T* (- Interfaces:) Tj
T* (  - POST `/emit` for backend event fanout.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
