(  - WebSocket for dashboard client subscriptions.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 3.4 Database) Tj
T* (- Engine: MySQL \(InnoDB + utf8mb4\).) Tj
T* (- Bootstrap schema: `backend/config/database/hospital_db.sql`.) Tj
T* (- Runtime schema hardening/extensions: `backend/utils/DbSchema.php`.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 4. Key Functional Modules) Tj
T* (- Authentication: login/logout, JWT issuance/validation, session tracking.) Tj
T* (- Admin: user management, shifts, settings, logs, monitoring dashboards.) Tj
T* (- Reception: patient registration, appointments, queue/check-in, referrals/consents.) Tj
T* (- Doctor: waiting list, consultations, prescriptions, tasks/escalations/discharge.) Tj
T* (- Nurse: beds, urgent care queues, tasks/escalations/handover, pharmacy request trigger.) Tj
T* (- Nurse Aid: triage queue handling, admitted/discharge views, triage analytics.) Tj
T* (- Pharmacy: pending prescriptions, dispensing, stock management, advanced pharmacy workflows.) Tj
T* (- IT Support: system overview, ticketing, audit search and operational checks.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 5. Authentication and Authorization) Tj
T* (### 5.1 Authentication) Tj
T* (- Login endpoint: `auth/login` \(POST\).) Tj
T* (- Token format: JWT \(HS256\) with configurable issuer/audience/expiration.) Tj
T* (- Default token lifetime: 1800 seconds \(30 minutes\).) Tj
T* (- Session model: JWT `sid` plus database-backed `user_sessions`/session metadata.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (### 5.2 Authorization) Tj
T* (- Route-level role checks through middleware.) Tj
T* (- Role normalization handles case/space/hyphen variants.) Tj
T* (- Supported roles include:) Tj
T* (  `admin`, `doctor`, `nurse`, `nurse_aid`, `pharmacist`, `senior_pharmacist`, `receptionist`, ) Tj
T* (`it_support`.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 6. API Surface \(High-Level\)) Tj
T* (Routing pattern:) Tj
T* (- Base: `/backend/index.php`) Tj
T* (- Module dispatch by first URI segment: `auth`, `admin`, `users`, `reception`, `doctor`, ) Tj
T* (`patients`, `nurse`, `nurse_aid`, `pharmacy`, `inventory`, `reports`, `logs`, `shifts`, ) Tj
T* (`settings`, `it`, `health`.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Representative endpoints \(examples\):) Tj
T* (- Auth: `/auth/login`, `/auth/logout`.) Tj
T* (- Reception: `/reception/register`, `/reception/appointments`, `/reception/queue_list`.) Tj
T* (- Doctor: `/doctor/waiting_list`, `/doctor/complete_refer`, `/doctor/analytics`.) Tj
T* (- Nurse: `/nurse/beds`, `/nurse/assign_bed`, `/nurse/pharmacy_request`.) Tj
T* (- Nurse Aid: `/nurse_aid/triage_queue`, `/nurse_aid/start_triage`.) Tj
T* (- Pharmacy: `/pharmacy/pending`, `/pharmacy/dispense`, `/pharmacy/analytics` and advanced ) Tj
T* (actions.) Tj
T* (- Inventory: `/inventory/list`, `/inventory/add`, `/inventory/update`.) Tj
T* (- IT: `/it/overview`, `/it/tickets`, `/it/ticket_create`, `/it/audit`.) Tj
T* (- Health: `/health`.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 7. Data Model) Tj
T* (### 7.1 Core Tables \(bootstrap SQL\)) Tj
ET
