T* (### 7.2 Runtime Extended Tables \(DbSchema helpers\)) Tj
T* (Examples include:) Tj
T* (- `staff_shifts`, `appointments`) Tj
T* (- `reception_handover`, `nurse_handover`, `doctor_handover`) Tj
T* (- `nurse_tasks`, `doctor_tasks`, escalation/discharge helper tables) Tj
T* (- Pharmacy advanced domain tables: interactions, controlled requests, refills, suppliers, ) Tj
T* (PO/GRN/invoices, quarantine, adjustments, insurance claims) Tj
T* (- Audit/activity tables managed by `ActivityLogger`) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 8. Realtime and Synchronization) Tj
T* (- Frontend connects to `ws://<hostname>:8090`.) Tj
T* (- Backend emits events through HTTP POST to sidecar \(`/emit`\).) Tj
T* (- Frontend combines:) Tj
T* (  - WebSocket event-triggered refresh.) Tj
T* (  - Fixed interval refresh \(10s\).) Tj
T* (  - Cross-tab sync via `BroadcastChannel` and storage events.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 9. Observability and Operations) Tj
T* (- Health endpoint returns:) Tj
T* (  - API status/version/time.) Tj
T* (  - Database connectivity status.) Tj
T* (  - Realtime socket reachability status.) Tj
T* (- Logging:) Tj
T* (  - Activity and audit logs through utility layer.) Tj
T* (  - Additional auth/login debug logs under `backend/logs`.) Tj
T* (- Monitoring scripts:) Tj
T* (  - `scripts/monitor_watch.ps1`) Tj
T* (  - `scripts/run_tests.ps1`) Tj
T* (  - `scripts/smoke_test.ps1`) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (## 10. Deployment and Environment) Tj
T* (Minimum local requirements:) Tj
T* (- XAMPP \(Apache + PHP + MySQL\).) Tj
T* (- Node.js 18+ for realtime service.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Baseline local path assumptions:) Tj
T* (- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\Hospital_Management_System`) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Startup order \(local\):) Tj
T* (1. Start Apache + MySQL \(XAMPP\).) Tj
ET
