(2. Ensure `hospital_db` schema imported.) Tj
T* (3. Configure `backend/config/database.php` and `backend/config/jwt.php`.) Tj
T* (4. Start realtime service in `realtime` \(`npm install`, `node server.js`\).) Tj
T* (5. Open `frontend/pages/auth/login.html`.) Tj
